<section class="questions-section section-shell" id="questions" aria-labelledby="questions-heading"><div class="questions-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>06</span> / Questions</p><h2 id="questions-heading">GOOD<br>QUESTIONS.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Where can I shop the product?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Choose the featured product in the Shop section to see its current price and availability. The packaging inspector shows the supplied design visualisation.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>How do I check out?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Add an available product to your cart, review the quantity, and continue to Shopify checkout. Available delivery and payment options are shown during checkout.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Where can I read the full label?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Use the packaging inspector’s Back Label view, or <a href="{{ 'belgian-chocolate-wpc-back-label.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open the original back-label PDF</a>. The product section also presents a readable transcription of the supplied artwork.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Does it contain allergens?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>The supplied label states: Contains Milk. Read the complete ingredients and usage notes in the product section and original artwork.</p></div></details><div class="faq-end" aria-hidden="true"><i class="faq-rule faq-rule-final"></i></div></div></section>

